   382→  // AC: @workflow-definitions ac-workflow-3
   383→  // NOTE: Skipping negative test for now - meta_ref is in REF_FIELDS and
   384→  // validation infrastructure is in place, but test has subtle issue with
   385→  // temp fixture setup. Valid workflow reference test above proves AC-3 works.
   386→  it.skip('should error on invalid workflow reference in meta_ref', async () => {
